  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to COVAX through UNICEF Norge - TV2 Humordugnad. Covid-19.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF Norge, a foundation supporting the work of UNICEF, has been allocated one of the two larger Norwegian telethons in 2021. The aim for the telethon is to raise money for COVAX. The allocation from the Norwegian government will go directly and entirely to this purpose.</narrative>
